<item>
  <title>TenneT 2GW Portfolio Program BalWin4, LanWin1</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/tennet-2gw-portfolio-program-balwin4-lanwin1</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/tennet-2gw-portfolio-program-balwin4-lanwin1" hreflang="en"&gt;TenneT 2GW Portfolio Program BalWin4, LanWin1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;2 2GW&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;HVDC marine stations&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;32,000 t &lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;topsides Wt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;13,000 t &lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;jacket&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;40–45 m &lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;water depth&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Full-scope delivery: design, fabrication, installation and commissioning of offshore converter platforms for BalWin4 and LanWin1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;“Design One, Build Many” program approach improves cost and operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fabricated at Dodsal Group’s Batam Fabrication Yard in Indonesia&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dedicated HVDC fabrication capacity and new block assembly and supporting infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Conversion of up to 2GW of offshore wind-generated electricity from 66 kV AC to 525 kV DC&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The 2GW HVDC program includes two HVDC grid connection systems, BalWin4 and LanWin1, each with a capacity of 2GW. This new 2GW standard more than doubles existing transmission capacity and requires fewer connections between offshore wind farms and onshore converter stations, reducing the environmental impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The platforms are designed to convert up to 2GW of offshore wind-generated electricity from 66kV AC to 525kV DC. This conversion facilitates efficient transmission of electricity to the onshore station, enabling the integration of renewable energy sources into the power grid at a significant scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;High Voltage Direct Current&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2026-01/2GW.png.webp?itok=e3TMLhFE" width="864" height="576" alt="TenneT 2GW" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-location field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Location&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Offshore Germany&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-scope field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Scope&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;EPFIC Hybrid Contracting Model&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
